<title>HUNGARY: Hungary to auction 2yr bonds of HUF 8 bln on Nov 7.</title>
<headline>Hungary to auction 2yr bonds of HUF 8 bln on Nov 7.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary will auction two-year government bonds, 1998/K series, worth eight billion forints nominally on November 7, the Government Debt Management Agency (AKK) said on Thursday in a statement.</p>
<p>    Date of issue		 3 October, 1996</p>
<p>    Date of maturity	    3 October, 1998</p>
<p>    Bills on offer		8,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Minimum net price	   98.98 pct</p>
<p>    Maximum yield		 23.35 pct</p>
<p>Yield at previous auction 22.85 pct (Oct 24)</p>
<p>NOTE - The 1998/K bond bears a fixed interest of annual 21.5 percent, to be paid twice a year.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
